    "explanation": "Maiev's unique ability to reliably Pull a number of Heroes to her works particularly well with Tanks who seek to set up crowd control chains. Assassins with large amounts of avoidable area of effect damage will also find Umbral Bind particularly useful. Additionally, she is also favored by having healers with good AoE spells to benefit from her engage."
