    "explanation": "Maiev's early game power and incredible mercenary camp clear speed make her a good pick in most maps. However, she excels in maps with numerous vents, bushes, and tiny corridors, as those will facilitate her engage with Spirit of Vengeance and Umbral Bind. Maiev becomes an even better pick if the map has several mercenaries for her to capture, since she will be able to dictate how the game will be played."
